#: proj5-extensions.md:1
msgid "Quantum effects: Possible project extensions"
msgstr "Quantum Effects：発展課題の提案"

#: proj5-extensions.md:3
msgid ""
"The example project here illustrates how you can calculate the dynamical "
"properties and nuclear quantum effects for a system of Lennard Jones "
"particles. The extension to this project is to try to run simulations like "
"those in the example report for a system of particles that interact through "
"a different pair potential. A sensible choice would be to re-use the "
"potential that you developed when extending [project "
"4](proj4-extensions.md)."
msgstr ""
"この課題例は、Lennard-Jones Particles 系の Dynamical Properties と Nuclear Quantum "
"Effects の計算法を示す。発展課題では、別の Pair Potential "
"で相互作用する系に、レポート例と同様のシミュレーションを適用する。[課題4](proj4-extensions.md)の発展で作った Potential"
" を再利用するのが妥当な選択である。"
